  m_text: "PROGRAMA\xC7\xC3O: HTML5, CSS3, JAVASCRIPT, REACT, TAILWINDCSS, TYPESCRIPT,
    PYTHON, C#, ANGULAR, NODEJS.\n\nFERRAMENTAS: TRELLO, FIGMA, CANVA, ILLUSTRATOR,
